  {
   "type": "textmedia",
   "header": "<h3> ZOLLER Turret Table </h3> <h1> Well-designed and comfortable </h1>",
   "body": "<p><strong>Not all turret tables are created equal! ZOLLER turret tables are extremely sturdy, simple to manipulate, and operate with absolute precision.</strong></p> <p>ZOLLER turret tables do not flex, even when holding long, overhanging, or heavy tools. They rotate effortlessly and without stopping into the required position. The pneumatic and electrical components are automatically docked. Lifting and lowering are power-operated by keystrokes, and the lowering process is electronically monitored and displayed optically. The choice of tool holders for the ZOLLER turret tables lies entirely with your requirements. You can choose between 4-, 6-, 8-, and 12-position configurations and a wide variety of possible tool holders.</p>",
   "images": [
    {
     "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/4/8/csm_hyperion_beladen_7d8fa8e167.webp",
     "alt": "",
     "w": 1454,
     "h": 1454
    }
   ],
