     "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/b/8/csm_bestueckung_6fach_9ae3d33bd9.webp",
     "alt": "",
     "w": 633,
     "h": 398,
     "title": "Configuration D 745 – 6-way pitch",
     "caption": "<figcaption> <h3>Configuration D 745 – 6-way pitch</h3> <p>For various tool holders. By rotating the turret, the user always has the correct tool holder within the measuring range.</p> </figcaption>"
    },
    {
     "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/0/9/csm_bestueckung_8fach_adda36b1c6.webp",
     "alt": "",
     "w": 633,
     "h": 398,
     "title": "Configuration D 745 – 8-way pitch",
     "caption": "<figcaption> <h3>Configuration D 745 – 8-way pitch</h3> <p>For four HGH-UZ Universalaufnahmen, two GA-PP basic mounts, and two GA basic mounts. The number of adapters and adapter tools posts that can be used is virtually unlimited.</p> </figcaption>"
    },
    {
     "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/5/7/csm_bestueckung_12fach_ee5625722e.webp",
     "alt": "",
     "w": 633,
     "h": 398,
     "title": "D 900 Insert – 12-fold pitch",
     "caption": "<figcaption> <h3>D 900 Insert – 12-fold pitch</h3> <p>HGH-UZ Universalaufnahme for tools that rotate and<br/> fixed tools – additional specialized tool holders for Göltenbodt, Schütte, Traub, Index, and others can be mounted.</p> </figcaption>"
    }
   ],
